            <div xml:id="d521">

                <pb facs="0853" n="717" sameAs="frus:frus1888p1/pg717"/>

                <head>No. 521.<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. White to Mr. Bayard.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Legation of the United States</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >London</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1888-05-14"><hi rendition="#italic">May</hi> 14, 1888</date>.
                        (Received May 26.)</dateline>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 752.]</seg></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: I have the honor to acquaint you that on
                    the 12th instant the delegates to the international sugar conference from
                    Germany, Austria-Hungary, Belgium, Denmark, Spain, France, Great Britain, Italy,
                    Holland, and Russia signed at the foreign office the “<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >protoeole de clôture</hi>,” <pb facs="0854" n="718" xml:id="pg718"/> of
                    which and of the “<hi rendition="#italic">projet de convention</hi>” annexed
                    thereto, I inclose three copies herewith.</p>
                <p>I shall have the honor of addressing to you a few observations with respect to
                    this document and to those <hi rendition="#italic">procès-verbal</hi> of the
                    late session of the conference, which have not yet been forwarded, as soon as I
                    shall have received the latter.</p>
                <p>I have, etc.,</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Henry White.</hi></signed></closer>



                <xi:include href="d521-a1.xml" xpointer="d521-a1"/>
